-uint16 gLightmap16[256 * 32] __attribute__((aligned(16)));
+ * gLightmap16 + 512 + (g << 9) + 2 * (int8)texel.  16.5 KB of SDRAM (.bss).
+ * OPT-2: 33 rows, g = 0..32 - the mesh shading gives 1..32 (transformMesh.i: clamp + 1), and
+ * row 32 is the 8-bit table's last 256 bytes (the asm's base is gLightmap - 128). */
+#define LMAP16_ROWS 33
+/* OPT-2: the rows start at gLightmap16 + 512, a multiple of 512 (the Gouraud loop finds its row
